    "reason": "[ev-430fc91e4c1d] says the default package registry itself is gone, not only the flag. It says all packages must now use fully qualified names, and that any package without a registry host name (e.g. `crossplane-contrib/provider-aws-s3:v1.23.0`) must be updated before upgrading. Checking only `cli-flag --registry set` therefore misses environments that relied on the implicit default with no flag set. The exposure has to include package resources whose spec.package has no registry host.",
